  "plain": "In 1996, on a farm near Varginha, a town in Brazil where people that year reported a UFO and a captured creature, a farmer named Fabio Furtado says an object came down right over his house. The documentary filmmaker James Fox tells Michels this as something Furtado told him. It is one of several accounts of a craft over Varginha, which together would put a real object in the sky at the time."
